    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d351-a7">

                <pb facs="0485" n="379" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg379"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 6.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">the municipal council.—mixed court.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Clipping from North China Daily News, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1905-12-12">December 12,
                        1905</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>The following letter, with inclosures, is ordered for publication as bearing on
                    the recent dispute at the court:</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">22nd June, 1905</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: I have the honor to forward to you: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>Translation of a dispatch from the taotai, dated 10th of June,
                            1905.</item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>Translation of a reply dated 21st of June, 1905.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p>As it appears impossible to come to terms with the local Chinese authorities I
                    have been instructed by my colleagues to proceed to Nanking and to discuss the
                    question with his excellency the viceroy.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, dear sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Doctor Knappe</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Consul-General for Germany and Senior
                        Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">F. Anderson</hi>, Esq.,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chairman Municipal Council.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
